      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOT MAJESTY (1) profiles strongly after two solid runs at Eagle Farm. Stripping fitter fourth-up, the rise in trip shouldn't bother and McColm's 3kg claim is a big help. Bold showing anticipated. SLIPSAIN (3) poses a real threat, having beaten HOT MAJESTY home last start despite a slow start and struggling to clear traffic, but now concedes a 4.5kg swing. Expecting Du Plessis to be more positive from the better draw and try to keep him out of trouble. DOWN UNDER STUNNAH (5) returns from Saturday company and boasts a good record over this track and trip. Has done his best work late in his two runs back and is ready for the rise in trip. INDAMOUSE (2) was impressive in his maiden win at the Sunny Coast with Michael Rodd aboard, but this is obviously tougher and he's untested at the trip. Keeping safe.",
